Unsupported notification action: (none)\", and [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]any producer can attach a structured report to a notification [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]through a generic, fail-closed ViewReport action.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plans:202607/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]notification_release_report.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-at[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page:[/dim]\n[#87AFFF]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-at/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]ViewReport action contract and report loader[/bold #D7AFFF]                  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]contract[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]contract: add the generic notification report contract, the fail-closed [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]loader that resolves a live report file or an inline snapshot, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]ViewReport registration in the badge/icon/toast tables, and the fix that[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]stops action-less notifications from raising an unsupported-action [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]warning.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Report preview pane and full-screen report modal[/bold #D7AFFF]              [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]ui[dim] · [dim][/dim]after contract[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]ui: render the loaded report in the notification modal's right pane with[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]a provenance header, open a scrollable full-screen ReportModal from [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Enter, wire the ViewReport dispatch branch, and cover both surfaces with[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]unit tests and PNG visual snapshots.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]ci_watch release ledger, published report, and notification [/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]wiring[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]chop[dim] · [dim][/dim]after contract[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]chop: give the bugyi-chops ci_watch chop a durable release ledger, a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]per-tick published release report document, pending release PR discovery[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]for every release repo, and notifications that carry the ViewReport [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]action.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Documentation and end-to-end verification[/bold #D7AFFF]                     [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]verify[dim] · [dim][/dim]after ui, chop[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]verify: document the ViewReport action and the ci_watch release report, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]then verify the whole path end to end against live axe state with the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]full check and visual suites.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-at","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.6-sol","phase_bead_id":"sase-at.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-05647d5647d9067769887d00de026926","started_at":"2026-07-29T14:56:19.777601+00:00","state":"completed"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"14f151a2b0518d2c37bf04b34b270caf48dd3b7ef18ddbe4f013d80b3cc41c37","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-at.land/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"293438329cb4cee63f28b1818a7c6be77d1abd548c64e175247eddfeee5c5c74","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-at.land/meta.json","size_bytes":580},"prompt":{"digest":"c2229b2f08880fd59a77ba588083a23896d4b410d64f51b200d0268d194dffc8","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-at.land/prompt.md","size_bytes":226},"state":{"digest":"d9347419ea4b1074c0fcc924ed162db3ecf4d6036a6eaf89e22983bbcd802c88","path":"agents/bbugyi200.ath